<title>Gouraud-Shaded Rotating Cube (Canvas 2D)</title>
<style>
  html, body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    height: 100%;
    background: #0b0e14;
    color: #cdd6e4;
    font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #stage {
    display: block;
    width: 100vw;
    height: 100vh;
    cursor: crosshair;
  }
  #hud {
    position: fixed;
    top: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: rgba(15, 20, 30, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(120, 160, 220, 0.25);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  #hud b { color: #7fd0ff; font-weight: 600; }
  #hud .val { color: #ffe08a; }
  kbd {
